t; a stack of papers handed over at check-in may not include the information needed most."}],["$","p","Give the team the previous office or laboratory name and approximate dates. Ask how permission to request records should be handled. Do not assume that every health system shares the same chart.",{"children":"Give the team the previous office or laboratory name and approximate dates. Ask how permission to request records should be handled. Do not assume that every health system shares the same chart."}]],false]}],["$","section","Make three simple sections",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make three simple sections"}],[["$","p","Use an envelope or folder you already have. The purpose is to make information easy to find, not to create a perfect medical history.",{"children":"Use an envelope or folder you already have. The purpose is to make information easy to find, not to create a perfect medical history."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"article-checklist","children":[["$","li","Front: photo ID and insurance card. Write down the plan, network or medical group questions you want answered.",{"children":"Front: photo ID and insurance card. Write down the plan, network or medical group questions you want answered."}],["$","li","Middle: all current medications, plus a note about what you actually take and anything you recently stopped or could not obtain.",{"children":"Middle: all current medications, plus a note about what you actually take and anything you recently stopped or could not obtain."}],["$","li","Back: records the office requested and a short list of other clinicians, recent tests and upcoming appointments.",{"children":"Back: records the office requested and a short list of other clinicians, recent tests and upcoming appointments."}]]}]]}],"$L26","$L27"],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]]}]
